# The Village taps for {G} but a Forest is no help to its own condition (CR 614.12): beside only a Forest it enters tapped
# (turn 3); once an Island is out the second Village enters untapped (turn 7), the positive control for the first.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Kishla Village
Island
Kishla Village
Forest x3
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Kishla Village.Play
? Bot1.Battlefield.Kishla Village.Tapped = true
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
[T7 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Kishla Village.Play
? Bot1.Battlefield.Kishla Village#2.Tapped = false

[Expect]
Turn = 7
Bot1.Battlefield.Kishla Village#1.Tapped = false
Bot1.Battlefield.Kishla Village#2.Tapped = false
